Super strong raid opponents.  A health bar is across the top, but no numeric value is displayed.  Each monster has a Block meter in the top right-hand corner under the health bar. At the start, the creature has x block and you deal 1/x damage. The block number goes down with time, and your damage thus increases. It takes some time for the block number to be at 0 and damage to be 100% of normal.


Each creature in the cell rewards with a unique currency that can be exchanged for buffs in the '''SHOP''' screen.  The buffs are substantial and can help you to progress through certain sections of the game.
