Note about the bell: It very rapidly increases enemies HP and attack stats by magnitudes, instead of wasting your precious keys by raising the enemy HP too high (checked by the right of the enemy HP bar (💙=1k'''⋅'''1QQ, ❤️=1k'''⋅'''1QQ💙, etc.); You can back out of the fight, or swiping the app closed. By fighting and successfully defeating bell enemies, you get many more rewards. 

Gorshank Note: Gorshank has a separate health bar for each head, which also have their own blocks. Once the first head is killed, Gorshank will swap heads and as his block decreases ''his'' damage and increases until he has as much damage as you have health, effectively instantly killing you. Kill the first head with as little damage as possible and save your usual damaging sequence for the second head. 

<nowiki>*</nowiki>Since these stats are variable, it's possible to simply check their values by choosing which battle you want to check, and instead of starting the fight, simply backing out. 

